# KARMA install procedures
# -----------------------

1. Go into the karma/trunk/ directory

2. Go into the directory config/ and make sure the scripts install-xxx have the user execute
permissions, otherwise do: chmod u+x install-*

3. Go back to the trunk directory level and type from that level:
 ./config/install-contrib.sh
This will install petsc, slepc, and libmesh.

4. From the trunk directory level, type 
./config/install-karma.sh
Read the script before trying this. It requires that some
env variables are set (for convenience, I have put them in 
the file envKARMA which is located at the ~/karma directory level)



